{"id":"ics-024","stemHtml":"<code>g</code> 是外部函数，参数和返回值都是 <code>long</code>。<code>f</code> 在 <code>-O0</code> 下的汇编如下：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">f:\n    pushq %rbp\n    movq %rsp, %rbp\n    pushq %rbx\n    subq $24, %rsp\n    movq %rdi, %rbx\n    movq %rdi, -32(%rbp)\n    call g\n    movq %rax, -24(%rbp)\n    movq -32(%rbp), %rax\n    addq -24(%rbp), %rax\n    addq $24, %rsp\n    popq %rbx\n    popq %rbp\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<p>(1) 还原 <code>f</code> 的 C 代码。</p>\n<p>(2) 局部变量区（从 <code>-32(%rbp)</code> 到 <code>-9(%rbp)</code>）共多少字节？其中数组占多少、填充占多少？</p>\n<p>(3) 若 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)=x+3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>，求 <code>f(7)</code>。</p>\n<p>(4) 如果删掉 <code>pushq %rbx</code> 和 <code>popq %rbx</code>，会出什么问题？</p>\n<p>(5) 为什么 <code>subq</code> 是 <code>$24</code> 而不是 <code>$16</code>？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<code>-32(%rbp)</code> 是数组首地址，<code>-24(%rbp)</code> 是它的第二个 <code>long</code>。<code>%rbx</code> 是被调用者保存寄存器，用来跨 <code>call</code> 保存参数。局部变量区大小既要容纳数据，也要保证 <code>call g</code> 之前 <code>%rsp</code> 对齐。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> 逐段翻译：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>movq %rdi, %rbx</code> 把参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 存到 <code>%rbx</code>；</li>\n<li<code>movq %rdi, -32(%rbp)</code> 把 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 存进数组第一个元素 <code>buf[0]</code>；</li>\n<li<code>call g</code> 调用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，返回值在 <code>%rax</code>；</li>\n<li<code>movq %rax, -24(%rbp)</code> 把结果存进 <code>buf[1]</code>；</li>\n<li>最后把 <code>buf[0]</code>、<code>buf[1]</code> 相加返回。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">long f(long x) {\n    long buf[2];\n    buf[0] = x;\n    buf[1] = g(x);\n    return buf[0] + buf[1];\n}</code></pre></p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> <code>buf</code> 是两个 <code>long</code>，占 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times8=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节，地址从 <code>-32(%rbp)</code> 到 <code>-17(%rbp)</code>。局部变量区从 <code>-32(%rbp)</code> 到 <code>-9(%rbp)</code>，共</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32-8=24\\ \\text{字节}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>其中数组占 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节，剩下的 <code>-16(%rbp)</code> 到 <code>-9(%rbp)</code> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 字节填充。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> <code>f(7)</code> 中 <code>buf[0]=7</code>，<code>buf[1]=g(7)=10</code>，返回</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7+10=17.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> <code>%rbx</code> 是<strong>被调用者保存</strong>寄存器，函数如果要用它，必须先保存旧值、返回前恢复。删掉 <code>pushq %rbx</code> 和 <code>popq %rbx</code> 有两个后果：</p>\n<ol>\n<li<code>call g</code> 之后，<code>g</code> 可以随意改写 <code>%rbx</code>，<code>f</code> 再读 <code>%rbx</code> 就拿到错误的值（本题中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 丢失，返回值错误）；</li>\n<li<code>f</code> 自己违反了调用约定，返回后调用者的 <code>%rbx</code> 已被破坏，可能连锁导致上层函数算错。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> 进入 <code>f</code> 时 <code>%rsp</code> 除以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>；<code>pushq %rbp</code> 后余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>；<code>pushq %rbx</code> 后余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>。若只 <code>subq $16</code>，<code>%rsp</code> 仍余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>，<code>call g</code> 前不满足 16 字节对齐。取 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节数组加 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 字节填充）后，</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>≡</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8-24\\equiv0\\pmod{16},</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.3333em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<code>%rsp</code> 恢复对齐，<code>call g</code> 时被调用者进入的约定才正确。所以 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span> 不是随便取的，而是「够用且能对齐」的最小值。</p>\n<p>结论：<strong>(1) 见解析的 C 代码；(2) 局部变量区 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span> 字节，数组 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节、填充 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 字节；(3) <code>f(7) = 17</code>；(4) <code>%rbx</code> 会被 <code>g</code> 覆盖，且违反被调用者保存约定；(5) 为了在 <code>call g</code> 前保持 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节对齐。</strong></p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>buf</code> 还原成 3 个元素，或把 <code>-24(%rbp)</code> 当成填充——它其实是 <code>buf[1]</code>。二是认为 <code>subq $16</code> 就够了，忽略对齐，导致 <code>call g</code> 前 <code>%rsp</code> 余 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>。三是忘记 <code>%rbx</code> 是被调用者保存寄存器，以为只有 <code>%rax</code> 会被 <code>call</code> 破坏。四是把 <code>addq -24(%rbp), %rax</code> 当成「把 <code>%rax</code> 存到 <code>-24</code>」，源和目的看反。五是以为 <code>-O0</code> 下编译器不会做这种「先用栈再用寄存器」的保存，实际上 <code>-O0</code> 的代码正是这样逐句翻译的。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <code>long f(long x){long buf[2]; buf[0]=x; buf[1]=g(x); return buf[0]+buf[1];}</code>；(2) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span> 字节，数组 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span>、填充 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>；(3) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span></span>；(4) <code>%rbx</code> 会被 <code>g</code> 覆盖，且违反被调用者保存约定；(5) 保持 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节对齐</p>\n"}